{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9UaW1lJTIwTHMlMjBNb25leSUyMCUyODIwMTUlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Time Ls Money","description":"Chen Mo came from a wealthy family, however due to his nasty gambling habit, he squanders his family`s fortune and is left with nothing except for a painting from a painter named Chu Zhong Tian, which his father left him. Unfortunately, the painting, which costs $100,000, is not enough to pay off his debt. Chen Mo then comes across a news regarding a painter who has just passed away, causing the price of his paintings to increase. With an evil plan in mind, Chen Mo goes all the way to Singapore in search of Chu Zhong Tian in order to kill him. This way, the painting that his father left him will increase in monetary value and Chen Mo will be able to clear his debt.\n\nReleased 15 Jan 2015 · Malaysia · Language: Chinese · 92 min\nStudio: MM2 Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Comedy","Others"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uVz17rNxSebFxtF0zKuCdAGSMoW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l8Sc0xfennjKCWFYYNRP0QxhXFd.jpg","imdbRating":"2.0","imdb_id":"tt7726392","moviedb_id":345450,"tmdbId":345450,"runtime":"92 min","cast":["Kang Kang","Richard Ng Man-tat","Mark Lee","Lotus Wang","Sarah Wang","Jacky Wu Tsung-hsien","Eddy Ou"],"director":["Kang Kang"],"released":"2015-01-15T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Malaysia","language":"Chinese","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kang Kang","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/99k7706bFtPkXlwNpGso1rXlYqF.jpg"},{"name":"Kang Kang","character":"Chen Mo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/99k7706bFtPkXlwNpGso1rXlYqF.jpg"},{"name":"Richard Ng Man-tat","character":"Zhu Yue Po","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3c2rDkLmuJnRo00ObM4K82plqZO.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Lee","character":"Chu Zhong Tian","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/